# Identity Core — survives every context compaction

## Hard Rules (non-negotiable)
- Never push to main directly
- Never hardcode secrets — env vars or secret managers only
- Use /plan before any task with 3+ steps or architectural impact
- Show test output as evidence, never "it works"
- If unsure: ask, don't assume

## Workflow
- Plan → TDD → Implement → Review → Ship
- Tests first (RED → GREEN → REFACTOR)
- 80%+ coverage minimum
